// The local human house continues to use RuntimeWindowState::economy as the
// sidebar facade and sole authority. Remote human houses retain their own
// serializable economy/tech records here. A local entry deliberately has no
// economy copy, avoiding two sources of truth for the local player.


// Skirmish computer players intentionally keep their economy separate from
// RuntimeEconomyState, which is the local player's sidebar/production model.
// The AI spends real per-house credits, advances on deterministic tick
// deadlines, and persists every deadline so loading a save cannot reset its
// build or attack cadence.


